 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 20, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 20, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 35}, 'text': 'support my career choices, funny you :)'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 15, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 30}, 'text': 'yeah I was right. i’m sorry to hear that'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 10, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 30, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 20, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 20}, 'text': 'it was unexpected , heart attack . but enough of me , how are you ?'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 20, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 30, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 25}, 'text': 'no, let’s talk about you. what is your job?'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 20, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 30}, 'text': "i'm a stay at home mother with a seven year old ."}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 20, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 20, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 35}, 'text': 'i see. what activities do you do with your child?'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 20, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 30}, 'text': 'what spare time ! ? mostly i study for school and play with my kids . you ?'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 35, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 20}, 'text': 'i love spending time with my family'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 30, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 30}, 'text': 'my parents like for us all to eat dinner together every night. Also, try to guess: my dream car ...'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 40}, 'text': 'is bmw'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 40}, 'text': 'is rolls royce ghost, funny you :)'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 10, 'Sadness': 15, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 20, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 45}, 'text': 'oh, i don’t know much about cars'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 40}, 'text': 'i just like cars that are fast. hows it going today ?'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 15, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 30, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 25}, 'text': 'okay :) it was nice talking to you. bye !'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 30, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 30}, 'text': 'thank you , i will , you have a wonderful day too ! how are you today ?'}}]}
