{'Anger': 25, 'Fear': 20, 'Joy': 10, 'Sadness': 30, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 5}, 'text': 'If you ask Plato corruption is just in the eyes of the beneficiary'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 20, 'Fear': 15, 'Joy': 10, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 20}, 'text': 'What is perversion when the end result is natural...'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 30, 'Fear': 20, 'Joy': 5, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 10}, 'text': "This is not Greece and I am not Plato and it doesn't take a philosopher to know then difference between right and wrong"}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 30, 'Fear': 25, 'Joy': 5, 'Sadness': 20, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 10}, 'text': 'A philosopher is meant only to examine the concept surrounding the premise without ever reaching a definitive answer'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 30, 'Fear': 25, 'Joy': 5, 'Sadness': 20, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 10}, 'text': 'To simplify it is critical thinking that enables one to think objectively about a subject'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 30, 'Fear': 25, 'Joy': 5, 'Sadness': 20, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 10}, 'text': "Yet objectivity doesn't make it right or wrong"}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 35, 'Fear': 30, 'Joy': 5, 'Sadness': 20, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 0}, 'text': 'Wow'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 40, 'Fear': 25, 'Joy': 5, 'Sadness': 20, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 5}, 'text': "I'm spending too much time on Facebook let me go check on Judas its almost changing time"}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 40, 'Fear': 30, 'Joy': 5, 'Sadness': 15, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 5}, 'text': 'Why would she leave me all I did was medically rape the children to make clones of them in our basement'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 30, 'Fear': 25, 'Joy': 5, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 5}, 'text': 'Does she not understand the scientific break through'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 35, 'Fear': 20, 'Joy': 5, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 5}, 'text': 'Does she not get what I have done'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 30, 'Fear': 20, 'Joy': 5, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 10}, 'text': 'All she does is cry when I call her'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 40, 'Fear': 30, 'Joy': 5, 'Sadness': 15, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 5}, 'text': "It's not wrong"}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 45, 'Fear': 30, 'Joy': 5, 'Sadness': 15, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 5}, 'text': "It's was science"}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 40, 'Fear': 30, 'Joy': 5, 'Sadness': 15, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 5}, 'text': 'Yes little Timmy now has a limp and cries at night but it was science'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 45, 'Fear': 30, 'Joy': 5, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 5}, 'text': 'The clones I made are the reason why I can operate this nursing home'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 50, 'Fear': 25, 'Joy': 5, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 5}, 'text': 'The serum I created with the stem cells from the live babies I killed using melissa eggs helped Mrs Haji walk again'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 50, 'Fear': 30, 'Joy': 5, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 0}, 'text': "I'm a freaking genius and all she care about is what I did to our children"}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 55, 'Fear': 30, 'Joy': 5, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 5}, 'text': 'I am god'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 50, 'Fear': 25, 'Joy': 5, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 5}, 'text': 'The giver of life and the take of life'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 50, 'Fear': 20, 'Joy': 5, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 10}, 'text': "Plato Socrates Michaelangelo and Galileo combined couldn't create the masterpieces of my design"}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 50, 'Fear': 20, 'Joy': 5, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 10}, 'text': 'I could create them'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 60, 'Fear': 30, 'Joy': 5, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 0, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 0}, 'text': 'I am the ultimate'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 60, 'Fear': 30, 'Joy': 5, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 0, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 0}, 'text': 'Why cry about a child when I can make a new one a better one... They are only a prototype compared to what I am capable of'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 50, 'Fear': 30, 'Joy': 5, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 5}, 'text': 'What is love'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 60, 'Fear': 30, 'Joy': 5, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 0, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 0}, 'text': "She runs when she sees me... Calls the police... She tried to destroy my work but you can't stop God"}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 30, 'Fear': 25, 'Joy': 5, 'Sadness': 20, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 15}, 'text': 'I can make Mrs. Haji young again and give her a new body'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 60, 'Fear': 30, 'Joy': 5, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 0, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 0}, 'text': 'Yes!'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 60, 'Fear': 30, 'Joy': 5, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 0, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 0}, 'text': 'That is what I will do'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 60, 'Fear': 30, 'Joy': 5, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 0, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 0}, 'text': 'Why cry over a specimen when I am the creator'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 60, 'Fear': 30, 'Joy': 5, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 0, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 0}, 'text': "Mrs.  Haji...  It's time for your injections"}}]}
